<title>FINLAND: Finnish August PPI falls 1.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish August PPI falls 1.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index fell 0.4 percent in August on July and it fell 1.3 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			   August 1996    July 1996	August 1995</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth		-0.4 pct	-0.6 pct	  +0.2 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		  -1.3 pct	-0.7 pct	  +2.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
